,"text":"Hobbies: Drinking tea"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The president of the student council who attends the special advance class. She engages in any action taking place at the school. She possesses a great power at the school, which is combined with her massive charisma and skills. Haruka is highly trusted amongst the teachers, she acts as a live example of what a perfect student should be like. She became the president of the student council being just a second-year student, which is a proof that her skills are not just for show. She seems to have connections both inside and outside the school."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Haruka is a young lady of a wealthy family, due to that she is able to attract students using her polite gestures, pleasant tone, and flower-like smile."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Haruka and Yukari are stepsisters with different mothers, Haruka is the one who has a British blood. Their relationship with one another is pretty awkward."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Roughly translated from Getchu (NSFW)."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c11483"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9a/9ad44ef8c53b4bda8e33958e6b603b4fa9648171f1b09747cb6d06e137e33629.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fd/fdd5ea1c00421b7253611498aa94dd15053d061e4c50f9ca8426a96c247ae7f9.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"青山 ゆかり","creatorId":"vndb:s83","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s83","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s83","name":"友永 朱音","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:19541","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c11484","characterName":"小林 玲南","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c11484"},"originalCharacterName":"小林 玲南","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"sour